p lq lr ls lt lu lv lw lx ly eo bj" data-selectable-paragraph=3D"">By getti=
ng a new access token using client credentials, we are no longer acting on =
the user=E2=80=99s behalf. In this grant type, the resource owner is the cl=
ient application (API1), who has an entirely different security profile tha=
